{"version":1,"key":"card:134","content":{"id":134,"content":[{"children":[{"text":"不带任何参数的 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"git push","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，默认只推送当前分支，这叫做 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"simple","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 方式。此外，还有一种 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"matching","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 方式，会推送所有有对应的远程分支的本地分支。Git 2.0版本之前，默认采用 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"matching","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 方法，现在改为默认采用 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"simple","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 方式。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"805f6741-3240-4bd7-95b8-3b5ac606793e","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"$ git config --global push.default matching\n# 或者\n$ git config --global push.default simple","collabId":"d85ce344-7e81-48b6-99ac-5e8d790ed689","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"b508408e-14da-45ee-8c88-decafba54625","language":"bash","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"4f87f859-d797-4534-942f-0fe5e1b3b422"}],"tags":["Git"],"createTime":1689473523420,"updateTime":1793532517852,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1793532517852}}